{"step_index":3275,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T08:38:05Z","thinking":"**Implementing Dead Man's Switch**\n\nI'm making progress on the Dead Man's Switch. The critical timer will be anchored to `/tmp/xoras_quorum_start_timestamp.txt`, marking the initiation of active execution. Now, I'm working on calculating the elapsed time in real seconds.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# XORAS VOICE DEAD MAN'S SWITCH V2 (MOVE 3: HARD ABORT ON SILENCE)\\n# Anchors timer to first agent dispatch start and enforces real elapsed time.\\n# If silence exceeds MAX_SILENCE_SECONDS, boot sequence is ABORTED with Exit Code 1.\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\n\\nMAX_SILENCE_SECONDS=\\\"${1:-15}\\\"\\nSTART_TS_FILE=\\\"/tmp/xoras_quorum_start_timestamp.txt\\\"\\nSPEECH_TS_FILE=\\\"/tmp/xoras_last_speech_timestamp.txt\\\"\\nSCRIPT_DIR=\\\"$(cd \\\"$(dirname \\\"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\\\")\\\" && pwd)\\\"\\nSPEAK_SCRIPT=\\\"${SCRIPT_DIR}/agent_speak.sh\\\"\\n\\nnow_epoch() {\\n  date +%s\\n}\\n\\nNOW=\\\"$(now_epoch)\\\"\\n\\n# 1. Read or initialize start timestamp\\nif [[ -f \\\"$START_TS_FILE\\\" ]]; then\\n  START_TS=\\\"$(cat \\\"$START_TS_FILE\\\" 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"$NOW\\\")\\\"\\nelse\\n  START_TS=\\\"$NOW\\\"\\n  echo \\\"$START_TS\\\" > \\\"$START_TS_FILE\\\"\\nfi\\n\\n# 2. Read last speech timestamp\\nif [[ -f \\\"$SPEECH_TS_FILE\\\" ]]; then\\n  SPEECH_TS=\\\"$(cat \\\"$SPEECH_TS_FILE\\\" 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"$NOW\\\")\\\"\\nelse\\n  SPEECH_TS=\\\"$START_TS\\\"\\nfi\\n\\n# Calculate real elapsed time since last spoken beat\\nELAPSED=$((NOW - SPEECH_TS))\\nTOTAL_RUN=$((NOW - START_TS))\\n\\nif (( ELAPSED > MAX_SILENCE_SECONDS )); then\\n  echo \\\"🚨 [DEAD MAN SWITCH ABORT] Silence violation! ${ELAPSED}s elapsed since last speech beat (Max limit: ${MAX_SILENCE_SECONDS}s).\\\" >&2\\n  echo \\\"   [TOTAL RUN TIME]: ${TOTAL_RUN}s | [STATUS]: ABORTING BOOT SEQUENCE.\\\" >&2\\n  \\n  # Trigger forced audio explanation before halting\\n  bash \\\"$SPEAK_SCRIPT\\\" \\\"jarvis\\\" \\\"Jarvis alert. Dead man switch triggered. Silence violation detected. Boot sequence aborted.\\\"\\n  \\n  exit 1\\nfi\\n\\necho \\\"🟢 [DEAD MAN SWITCH] Real elapsed speech heartbeat: ${ELAPSED}s since last beat (Limit: ${MAX_SILENCE_SECONDS}s | Run: ${TOTAL_RUN}s).\\\"\\n\"","Description":"\"Hard-failing Voice Dead Man's Switch V2 script in 100% Pure Bash\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/voice_deadman_switch.sh\"","toolAction":"\"Writing hard-failing voice_deadman_switch.sh script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write voice_deadman_switch.sh V2\""}}]}
