ifact hash provided for node '${PAYLOAD:0:30}'.\\\" >&2\\n    exit 1\\n  fi\\nfi\\n\\necho \\\"🟢 [EVIDENCE DAG GATE] Verified Evidence Artifact Hash: ${ARTIFACT_HASH:0:16}...\\\"\\n\\n# Commit to Merkle Catch DAG with mandatory evidence hash\\npython3 \\\"$DAG_SCRIPT\\\" commit \\\"$AGENT\\\" \\\"$BEAT_TYPE\\\" \\\"$PAYLOAD\\\" --artifact \\\"$ARTIFACT_HASH\\\"\\n\"","Description":"\"Evidence-Gated Merkle DAG Committer script in 100% Pure Bash\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/evidence_dag_gate.sh\"","toolAction":"\"Writing pure bash evidence_dag_gate.sh script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write pure bash evidence_dag_gate.sh\""}}]}
